This app uses FFmpeg 8.1.3 (https://ffmpeg.org) under the GNU Lesser General
Public License version 2.1 or later. FFmpeg is dynamically linked and is built
unmodified from the release tarball:

  https://ffmpeg.org/releases/ffmpeg-8.1.3.tar.xz
  SHA-256 7138d28c96d9d3e3af4ee3d8cad72741f8ffb40da90c1112235dea3ecd3178a3

Build script: packages/extracter_native/scripts/build_ffmpeg.sh in the app's
source. Configure flags (decode-only; no GPL, non-free or external libraries
besides the system zlib):

